  The article's place is only 'வளாகம்' (campus) with no named town; the draft asserts the meeting was held in Namakkal (நாமக்கல்லில்) and in 'நாமக்கல் மாவட்டத்தில்', which goes beyond what the article states, though the article does mention Namakkal district in connection with the கலந்தாய்வு.
